---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import raaBannerImage from '../../assets/images/raa-banner.png';
import raaHolidayImage from '../../assets/images/raa-holiday.png';
import raaFuelMapImage from '../../assets/images/raa-fuel-map.png';
import raaFigmaImage from '../../assets/images/raa-figma.png';
import raaWiresMobileImage from '../../assets/images/raa-wires-mobile.png';
import uofaBannerImage from '../../assets/images/uofa-banner.png';

const highlights = [
  { label: 'Organisation', value: 'RAA & University of Adelaide' },
  { label: 'Role', value: 'Senior UX Design Lead' },
  { label: 'Scope', value: 'Web, mobile app, native iOS & Android' },
];
---
<Layout
  title="UI Design & Product Delivery | Andrew Smith"
  description="UI design and product delivery across RAA Travel, RAA mobile app, and University of Adelaide — from wireframes through to shipped product."
  ogType="article"
  ogImageAlt="RAA Travel website across desktop and mobile devices"
>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a>
  <div class="case-page">
    <SiteHeader />
    <main id="main-content">
      <section class="case-hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">
          <a class="breadcrumb-link" href="/work">Work</a>
          <span class="breadcrumb-separator" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          <span>UI Design &amp; Product Delivery</span>
        </p>
        <h1 class="display-title">The design is only as good as how well it survives handover.</h1>
        <div class="hero-subgrid">
          <p class="hero-text">
            Design delivery is everything between a research finding and a shipped feature. Information
            architecture, interaction design, prototyping, high-fidelity UI, developer handover, and QA.
            Each step is a decision point where the original intent can be preserved or lost.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="meta-strip" id="overview">
        {highlights.map((item) => (
          <div class="meta-item">
            <p class="meta-label">{item.label}</p>
            <p class="meta-value">{item.value}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </section>

      <section class="lead-image-section">
        <Image class="lead-image" src={raaBannerImage} alt="RAA Travel website shown across desktop, tablet, and mobile" decoding="async" widths={[720, 1080, 1440]} sizes="(max-width: 78rem) 100vw, 78rem" />
      </section>

      <section class="summary-section">
        <p class="section-kicker">RAA Travel</p>
        <h2>A complex multi-product booking experience designed for web and mobile.</h2>
        <div class="summary-main">
          <p>RAA Travel covers flights, stays, holidays, cruises, car hire, and attractions — a significant UX challenge across multiple booking flows, each with different user mental models, decision points, and failure modes.</p>
          <p>As lead designer, I owned the experience end-to-end: user research, information architecture, interaction design, prototyping for usability testing, high-fidelity UI, and QA review against the design system.</p>
          <p class="summary-meta"><strong>Scope:</strong> Search and booking flows, product detail pages, mobile-responsive across all device sizes</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="supporting-image-section">
        <Image class="supporting-image" src={raaHolidayImage} alt="RAA Travel holiday detail page showing cruise itinerary with pricing and booking" loading="lazy" decoding="async" widths={[720, 1080, 1440]} sizes="(max-width: 78rem) 100vw, 78rem" />
      </section>

      <section class="editorial-section" id="process">
        <div class="section-rail">
          <p class="section-kicker">RAA Mobile App</p>
        </div>
        <div class="story-block">
          <p>Lead designer on the RAA app's fuel price map, member deals, and MaaS features. The fuel map shows real-time fuel prices across Adelaide with station detail, routing, and competitive pricing indicators.</p>
          <p>The process ran from low-fidelity wireframes in Miro through Figma prototype to production — with real users tested at each stage before any development began. The wireframes below show the deals and favourites information architecture before visual design was applied.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="supporting-image-section">
        <Image class="supporting-image" src={raaFuelMapImage} alt="RAA app fuel price map showing Adelaide suburb prices with station detail drawer" loading="lazy" decoding="async" widths={[720, 1080, 1440]} sizes="(max-width: 78rem) 100vw, 78rem" />
      </section>

      <section class="supporting-image-section">
        <Image class="supporting-image" src={raaWiresMobileImage} alt="Low-fidelity wireframes for RAA app deals, categories, and favourites screens" loading="lazy" decoding="async" widths={[720, 1080, 1440]} sizes="(max-width: 78rem) 100vw, 78rem" />
      </section>

      <section class="supporting-image-section">
        <Image class="supporting-image" src={raaFigmaImage} alt="Figma canvas showing RAA app fuel offer prototype screens across multiple pages" loading="lazy" decoding="async" widths={[720, 1080, 1440]} sizes="(max-width: 78rem) 100vw, 78rem" />
      </section>

      <section class="editorial-section">
        <div class="section-rail">
          <p class="section-kicker">University of Adelaide</p>
        </div>
        <div class="story-block">
          <p>Before RAA, five years as UX designer and front-end developer at the University of Adelaide — building both the product and the system that governed it. The university website redesign covered the full public-facing site, responsive across all device sizes, built on a custom Drupal CMS platform.</p>
          <p>The styleguide application (detailed in the Design Systems case study) meant every interface built across the university shared the same foundations — consistent typography, layout patterns, accessible components, and documented usage guidelines.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="supporting-image-section">
        <Image class="supporting-image" src={uofaBannerImage} alt="University of Adelaide website shown across desktop, tablet, and mobile" loading="lazy" decoding="async" widths={[720, 1080, 1440]} sizes="(max-width: 78rem) 100vw, 78rem" />
      </section>

    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .case-page { position: relative; width: min(calc(100% - 3rem), 78rem); margin: 0 auto; padding: 1.25rem 0 5rem; }
  .eyebrow { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted-foreground); margin: 0 0 1.25rem; display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center; }
  .breadcrumb-link { font-weight: 600; }
  .breadcrumb-separator { color: var(--muted-foreground); }
  h1, h2 { margin: 0; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.05em; color: var(--foreground); }
  .display-title { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.5rem); line-height: 1.06; margin: 1rem 0 0; max-width: 28ch; }
  .hero-subgrid { margin-top: 1.75rem; }
  .hero-text, .story-block p, .summary-main p, .closing-text, .summary-meta { font-size: 1.08rem; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .case-hero { padding: 5rem 0 2rem; }
  .meta-strip { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; padding: 1.5rem 0 0.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .meta-label { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted-foreground); margin: 0; }
  .meta-value { margin: 0.35rem 0 0; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .lead-image-section { padding: 2rem 0 4rem; }
  .lead-image, .supporting-image { width: 100%; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 1.5rem; box-shadow: var(--shadow-large); }
  .supporting-image-section { padding: 2rem 0 4rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .summary-section { padding: 0 0 3rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .summary-section h2 { margin-top: 0.75rem; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 2.2rem); max-width: 32ch; }
  .summary-main { margin-top: 1.5rem; max-width: 44rem; }
  .section-kicker { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted-foreground); margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
  .editorial-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 14rem minmax(0,1fr); gap: 2rem; padding: 3rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .story-block { max-width: 44rem; }
</style>
